Recognize returning callers in the opening line (M7 test #2)

The AI's greeting was static, so a call-back customer heard a generic
"how can I help you" instead of being recognized. We already matched the
caller to their CRM contact at call setup but didn't use it until a later
lookup_contact.

- prompt.ts: begin_message is now {{opening_line}} (injected per call)
- /api/twilio/voice: builds a returning-caller opening that greets by name
  and references their last need ("Welcome back, Josh! ...about your dead
  battery on I-71, or something new?"); passes last_need + opening_line as
  dynamic variables
- prompt.ts: returning callers are not asked their name again; the AI calls
  lookup_contact to pull history

Re-syncs the Retell agent automatically on the next call (prompt hash changed).

